// ==============================================================================
// VerySync (微力同步) 过滤规则 - hanzi-chai.github.io_fork 专项目录
// 策略: 过滤巨大前端与Python依赖(~930MB)；放行并保护 .local 标注核心数据；保护 Git 锁
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Git 多端并发安全保护（保留仓库与提交历史，排除锁与瞬态工作态）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/*.lock
**/.git/index.lock
**/.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
**/.git/TAG_EDITMSG
**/.git/FETCH_HEAD
**/.git/ORIG_HEAD
**/.git/rebase-apply
**/.git/rebase-merge
.git/*.lock
.git/index.lock
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. Node.js / 前端依赖与构建产物 (过滤约 731 MB node_modules + 34 MB dist)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)node_modules
(?d)dist
(?d)dist-ssr
(?d).next
(?d).turbo
(?d).cache
(?d).wrangler
(?d)coverage
(?d)test-results

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. Python 运行环境与解析器缓存 (tools/glyph-decomposer: 约 202 MB .venv)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.py[cod]
(?d)*$py.class
(?d).venv
(?d)venv
(?d).pytest_cache
(?d).ruff_cache

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4. 环境敏感配置与编辑器缓存 (防止本地环境变量被覆盖)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d).env
(?d).dev.vars
(?d).idea
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.log
(?d)npm-debug.log*
(?d)yarn-debug.log*
(?d)yarn-error.log*
(?d)pnpm-debug.log*
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 通用编辑器单机状态与本地临时文件隔离（防止双端抢锁与窗口/光标覆盖）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Sublime Text (保留 .sublime-project，严防单机窗口/光标覆盖)
(?d)*.sublime-workspace

// 2. VS Code / Cursor / Zed / Helix / JetBrains / Visual Studio 单机缓存与本地状态
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d).vscode/ipch
(?d).vscode/.browse.*
(?d).vscode/*.log
(?d).cursor/cache
(?d).cursor/state
(?d).zed/settings.local.json
(?d).helix/*.local.toml
(?d).helix/*.log
(?d).idea
(?d)*.suo
(?d)*.user
(?d)*.userosv
(?d)*.sln.docstates

// 3. Vim / Neovim / 交换文件 / 临时文本 / Office 独占锁
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d).netrwhist
(?d)~$*
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.bak
